  "description": "Luxury 2-Bedroom Apartment at Custume Pier, Athlone Town Centre\n\nExperience stylish town-centre living in this beautifully presented two-bedroom luxury apartment at Custume Pier, Athlone. Ideally positioned in the heart of Athlone, this exceptional property combines modern comfort with a highly convenient location.\n\nThe apartment offers a bright and contemporary living space, with a spacious open-plan kitchen and living area designed for both relaxing and entertaining. The modern kitchen is well equipped, while the generous living area provides an inviting setting overlooking the surrounding town-centre environment.\n\nBoth bedrooms are well proportioned, with the principal bedroom offering excellent space and comfort. The apartment also benefits from a modern bathroom and quality finishes throughout.\n\nLocated within easy walking distance of Athlone town centre, residents can enjoy an excellent selection of shops, restaurants, cafés, bars and local amenities right on the doorstep. The River Shannon and Athlone's vibrant waterfront are also close by, while excellent transport links make the property ideal those seeking a convenient central home.\n",
